@startuml
title Signal Write — Arch Flow

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "API (write_signal)" as API
participant "Writer\n(encode+send)" as Writer
participant "CAN Bus" as Bus
participant ECU

== Write path ==
User -> Frontend : Input signal value
Frontend -> API : PUT /signals/{name}
API -> API : Auth + parse body
API -> Writer : send_signal(name, value)
Writer -> Writer : Encode via CAN DB
Writer -> Bus : CAN frame (async)
Bus -> ECU : Deliver
API -> Frontend : 202 Accepted

note right of API
  OUTDATED: Route-level checks NOT implemented
  - Rate-limit check: missing (config exists, not enforced)
  - Shutdown guard: missing (no is_shutting_down check)
  - Writable validation: missing (skips store.get())
  See SDD_sequence_signal_write & SDD_DETAILED_VERIFICATION.md
end note

@enduml
